@startuml
' ArchGround sequence diagram
' diagram: telemetry-command-flow
' flow: Telemetry command flow
' author: Space Mission Sample Team
' language: en
' grounding digest: sha256:f884c9f47f411fd141bcc79eb6b2da88f11a8bb437a129f91304b11ef65922d2
' generator: scripted-demo

actor "Flight Controller" as kp_flight_controller
participant "Mission Control" as kp_mission_control
participant "Command Service" as kp_command_service
queue "Command Queue" as kp_command_queue
participant "Orbital Relay" as kp_orbital_relay
participant "Telemetry Service" as kp_telemetry_service
database "Telemetry Store" as kp_telemetry_store

kp_flight_controller -> kp_mission_control : Submit prepared command (INTERNAL: Operator Console)
kp_mission_control -> kp_command_service : Send command request (REST API: Command API)
kp_command_service -> kp_command_service : Validate command (INTERNAL)
kp_command_service --> kp_mission_control : Command validation result (REST API: Command API)
kp_command_service ->> kp_command_queue : Publish accepted command (EVENT: Command Accepted Event)
kp_command_queue ->> kp_orbital_relay : Forward queued command (EVENT: Uplink Frame)
kp_orbital_relay ->> kp_telemetry_service : Deliver telemetry frames (EVENT: Downlink Frame)
kp_telemetry_service -> kp_telemetry_store : Store decoded telemetry (DB)

legend right
Legend
Actor symbol: grounded actor from the Knowledge Pack
Box, database or queue symbol: grounded system from the Knowledge Pack
[NEW] prefix: confirmed new participant, not part of the Knowledge Pack
Solid arrow with filled head: synchronous interaction
Arrow with open head: asynchronous interaction
Dashed arrow: response to a synchronous request
endlegend
@enduml
